{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "05", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "04", "M": "52", "S": "46"}}, "news": [{"title": "Income tax department attaches prime Gopanpally land parcels over benami deals", "para": "The income tax department has taken action by attaching three land parcels estimated at \u20b95.52 crore. These acquisitions by registered holders occurred without any payment. Investigators uncovered that the ownership-like rights were obtained through irrevocable general power of attorney agreements. The identity of the beneficial owners remains a mystery due to the inability to trace funding sources.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/income-tax-department-attaches-prime-gopanpally-land-parcels-over-benami-deals/132890378?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-188188/132890378.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Delhi HC expresses concern over \u201cuninhabitable\u201d condition of JNNURM flats", "para": "The Delhi High Court raised alarms regarding the uninhabitable apartments constructed under the JNNURM scheme. With an investment of two thousand crore rupees, these flats have stood empty for years. Authorities failed to house any residents, indulging in a misuse of taxpayer funds. DUSIB attributed this issue to neglect and diminishing interest, prompting the court to scrutinize the squandering of public resources on these initiatives.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/delhi-hc-expresses-concern-over-uninhabitable-condition-of-jnnurm-flats/132890017?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-62732/132890017.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Director of 32nd Milestone, wife held in Kolkata for allegedly cheating investor", "para": "Gurgaon police